{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a run-down maid cafe and rebuild it from scratch alongside unique kemonomimi maids. Each maid has her own personality and secrets. Together, chase the ultimate dream: earning the legendary <strong>Maidchelin 3-Star</strong> rating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232690/extras/22af3e93bb80c92dd4780888dfcce447.webp?t=1773296511\" width=436 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your cafe from a first-person perspective. Take orders, cook meals, serve customers, and handle every aspect of daily operations with your own hands. No menus to click\u2014you're on the floor, living the manager's life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232690/extras/eb1ef8c12cfc65b8184fb1c5a8a9ab80.poster.avif?t=1773296511\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232690/extras/eb1ef8c12cfc65b8184fb1c5a8a9ab80.webm?t=1773296511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232690/extras/eb1ef8c12cfc65b8184fb1c5a8a9ab80.mp4?t=1773296511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232690/extras/b3bee47731ba9dcaef2977c1c80fc9db.webp?t=1773296511\" width=436 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new equipment and expand your cafe space to welcome more guests. Strategically arrange furniture and optimize your layout for maximum efficiency and customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232690/extras/687cfc82be7363b6c63eaf7b0c41e5df.poster.avif?t=1773296511\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232690/extras/687cfc82be7363b6c63eaf7b0c41e5df.webm?t=1773296511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232690/extras/687cfc82be7363b6c63eaf7b0c41e5df.mp4?t=1773296511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232690/extras/7d3fd07787437ad869857435a15120bd.webp?t=1773296511\" width=436 height=59 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face troublesome customers and rival cafes head-on. Handle aggressive guests, prevent theft, and protect your maids. Not every day will be peaceful\u2014some challenges require quick action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232690/extras/75fe1ba4c7d2c805a896e2954d6f207b.poster.avif?t=1773296511\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232690/extras/75fe1ba4c7d2c805a896e2954d6f207b.webm?t=1773296511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232690/extras/75fe1ba4c7d2c805a896e2954d6f207b.mp4?t=1773296511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232690/extras/a5c72f52d4a3bf2a26b6ed21cc0f2cf8.webp?t=1773296511\" width=436 height=59 /></span></